# Archived docs

Files under `docs/archive/` are **historical**. The Foundry POC and other finished milestones
live here.

- Do not use them as current design authority.
- Do not edit them unless the user explicitly asks to correct the historical record.
- Prefer `docs/rules/`, `docs/research/`, live `docs/system/`, and `docs/forge/`.
